cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Agent-Readiness of 50 Cross-Border DTC Brands (2026)"
abstract: "Audit of machine-readable agent-readiness signals (UCP manifest, agent-payments endpoint, MCP endpoint, llms.txt, robots.txt AI-crawler directives, schema.org Product) on the owned storefronts of 50 Chinese-origin cross-border DTC brands with US-facing storefronts (47 reachable). 25 of 25 UCP manifests found at collection (2026-08) were Shopify-issued: 22 confirmed live by powered-by header on 2026-08-21, 3 (Anker, Soundcore, eufy) no longer served and attributed by collection-time *.myshopify.com host hint."
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://canlah.ai/data/agent-readiness-2026/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Canlah-AI/agent-readiness-2026"
keywords:
